Pseudocode for the wireframe of the Learners Landing Page:
# SkillsTrack Landing Page 

// This is the main page a learner sees after logging in

START PAGE

// TOP OF PAGE - HEADER
SHOW logo
SHOW navigation menu with links: Home, My Goals, Tasks, Support, Progress
  SHOW logout button
  
  
  // LEARNER INFORMATION
  DISPLAY learner's name
  DISPLAY programme name
  
  
  // PROGRESS BAR
  GET learner's overall progress percentage
  SHOW progress bar (example: 60% complete)
  DISPLAY text: "60% complete"
  
  
  // FOUR SUMMARY BOXES IN A ROW
  
  Box 1:
    SHOW "Goals"
    COUNT total goals
    DISPLAY number (example: 12)
  
  Box 2:
    SHOW "Outstanding Tasks"
    COUNT tasks not yet done
    DISPLAY number (example: 7)
  
  Box 3:
    SHOW "Overdue Tasks"
    COUNT tasks past due date
    DISPLAY number in red (example: 2)
  
  Box 4:
    SHOW "Support Bookings"
    COUNT upcoming sessions
    DISPLAY number (example: 3)
  
  
  // MAIN CONTENT AREA (4 SECTIONS)
  
  Section 1 - My Goals (top left):
    SHOW heading "My Goals"
    LIST all goals:
      - Goal 1
      - Goal 2
      - Goal 3
      - Goal 4
    SHOW button "Add Goal"
  
  
  Section 2 - My Support Bookings (top right):
    SHOW heading "My Support Bookings"
    FOR EACH upcoming booking:
      DISPLAY date
      DISPLAY time
      DISPLAY mentor name
      DISPLAY topic
    SHOW button "Book New Session"
  
  
  Section 3 - Progress Quiz (bottom left):
    SHOW heading "Progress Quiz"
    DISPLAY quiz title
    DISPLAY quiz description
    SHOW small progress bar (how many questions done)
    DISPLAY "5 of 10 questions complete"
    SHOW button "Start Quiz"
  
  
  Section 4 - My Tasks (bottom right):
    SHOW heading "My Tasks"
    LIST all tasks:
      - Checkbox + Task 1 + due date
      - Checkbox + Task 2 + due date
      - Checkbox + Task 3 + due date
      - Checkbox + Task 4 + due date
      - Checkbox + Task 5 + due date
  
  
  // BOTTOM OF PAGE - FOOTER
  SHOW links: Help Center, Terms, Privacy
  SHOW contact email and phone
  SHOW copyright: "© 2026 SkillsTrack"

END PAGE
